import{_ as t,o,c as i,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 411 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Ji Ning vs. Shi Hao: Predation Comparison Between Manghuang and Perfect World","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 411 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Ji Ning vs. Shi Hao: Predation Comparison Between Manghuang and Perfect World","no":411,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Ji Ning","Perfect World","Shi Hao","Predation Comparison"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","17-Plane Transcendent Standards","261-Tang-Luo Enlightened-Predator Verdict"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0411_模块2-莽荒纪-纪宁vs石昊-莽荒与完美的掠夺对比.md","filePath":"en/0411_模块2-莽荒纪-纪宁vs石昊-莽荒与完美的掠夺对比.md"}'),s={name:"en/0411_模块2-莽荒纪-纪宁vs石昊-莽荒与完美的掠夺对比.md"};function a(r,e,l,h,d,g){return o(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-411-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-ji-ning-vs-shi-hao-predation-comparison-between-manghuang-and-perfect-world" tabindex="-1">Entry 411 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Ji Ning vs. Shi Hao: Predation Comparison Between Manghuang and Perfect World <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-411-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-ji-ning-vs-shi-hao-predation-comparison-between-manghuang-and-perfect-world" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 411 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Ji Ning vs. Shi Hao: Predation Comparison Between Manghuang and Perfect World&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 16) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 17, 261</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-two-youths-walking-out-of-the-great-wilderness-whose-road-eats-myriad-ranks-more" tabindex="-1">Introduction: two youths walking out of the great wilderness, whose road &quot;eats&quot; Myriad Ranks more <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-two-youths-walking-out-of-the-great-wilderness-whose-road-eats-myriad-ranks-more" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: two youths walking out of the great wilderness, whose road &quot;eats&quot; Myriad Ranks more&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The six top-level axioms take the anti-predation axiom as bottom line. This entry compares <em>Manghuang Ji</em>&#39;s Ji Ning (lone-path / high-leaning-medium) with <em>Perfect World</em>&#39;s Shi Hao (Heaven Emperor Huang, the other extreme of predatory growth). Shi Hao is known for &quot;devouring&quot; — swallowing sun and moon, swallowing all things, taking the body as seed; his predation intensity ranks among the top among protagonists across the realms. Ji Ning dual-system devours; Shi Hao takes &quot;devouring&quot; itself and cultivates it into a Great Dao. This entry distinguishes the two predations&#39; intensity and structural differences. Protagonist uniqueness dependency: Ji Ning = high-leaning-medium, Shi Hao = high. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Both are devouring types, but Shi Hao&#39;s devouring is more &quot;internalized&quot;: he directly swallows sun, moon, stars, and all laws into himself, taking the body as seed. Ji Ning at least still splits body-refining and qi-refining two lines; Shi Hao treats the entire cosmos as his dantian. <strong>Shi Hao&#39;s energy waste lies in — the more he swallows, the flatter the cosmos as external ecology becomes; the fuller one person alone, the emptier Myriad Ranks.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The two&#39;s regression mechanisms compared:</p><ol><li><strong>Shi Hao = devouring-style regression</strong>: taking the body as seed, after devouring all things, the external world becomes nourishment for his &quot;inner cosmos&quot;</li><li><strong>Ji Ning = resource-style regression</strong>: devours resources not the world, but also zero-sum</li><li><strong>Common lesion</strong>: both define &quot;getting strong&quot; as &quot;possessing more,&quot; never as &quot;getting strong together with Myriad Ranks&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The two&#39;s predation key differences:</p><ul><li><strong>Ji Ning = grabbing resources</strong>: grabs secret realms, spiritual veins, cave-heavens; plunders &quot;stock resources&quot;</li><li><strong>Shi Hao = swallowing the world</strong>: swallows sun and moon, swallows laws; plunders &quot;the cosmos itself&#39;s existence&quot;</li><li><strong>Who is more extreme?</strong>: Shi Hao&#39;s &quot;taking the body as seed&quot; is philosophically more radical — he wants to turn the entire cosmos into a part of himself. Ji Ning still only &quot;uses&quot; resources; Shi Hao &quot;eats&quot; the world. <strong>Neither has walked out of the old road of &quot;plundering stock,&quot; only differing in magnitude.</strong></li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Ji Ning (Resource Plunder)</th><th>Shi Hao (World Swallowing)</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Plunder target</td><td>Cave-heavens, spiritual veins, secret realms</td><td>Sun, moon, stars, laws</td><td>No plunder; develop increment</td></tr><tr><td>Growth path</td><td>Dual-system resource stacking</td><td>Body-as-seed, devour cosmos</td><td>Myriad Ranks&#39; origin dual circulation</td></tr><tr><td>Cosmos relation</td><td>Use the cosmos</td><td>Eat the cosmos</td><td>Symbiosis with the cosmos</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad Ranks&#39; status</td><td>Fuel</td><td>Nourishment</td><td>Equal evolution qualification</td></tr><tr><td>Alternative direction</td><td>Resource joint contracting</td><td>Life-cycle system</td><td>Anti-predation enshrined</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate &quot;Ji Ning grabs resources,&quot; &quot;Shi Hao swallows world,&quot; &quot;Anchor Symbiosis&quot; three models</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: observe the cosmos as external ecology&#39;s &quot;remaining amount&quot; changing with protagonist growth</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: external world integrity, Myriad-Ranks survival rate, protagonist individual energy</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — under the devouring model the external world approaches zero as protagonist grows; under the symbiotic model protagonist and external world flourish together</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: Ji Ning medium-low vs. Shi Hao medium-low</strong>. Both dragged by realm inflation</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: Ji Ning high vs. Shi Hao high</strong>. Shi Hao late multi-book linkage (<em>Sacred Void</em>) also retcons</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: Ji Ning high-leaning-medium vs. Shi Hao high</strong> — Shi Hao as &quot;Heaven Emperor Huang&quot; has stronger single-log flavor</li></ul><p>Shi Hao&#39;s swallowing and Ji Ning&#39;s grabbing also have a philosophical divide: Ji Ning grabs usable resources; Shi Hao swallows everything. Ji Ning at least still treats the cosmos as external world to use; Shi Hao wants to eat even the external world. This means Shi Hao&#39;s road walked to the end leaves in the cosmos only him and his inner small cosmos — that is not strength, but self-seclusion at ultimate loneliness. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s symbiotic system is the opposite: it wants the strong to flourish together with the external world, not to eat the external world empty and then individually perfect.</p><p>Shi Hao and Ji Ning&#39;s predation-intensity difference also shows in attitude toward ecology. Ji Ning at least still goes around; Shi Hao swallows whatever he sees. This difference seems subtle, but actually decides the relation between civilization and the external world: use the external, or eliminate the external. Heng Yuan Zhou chooses symbiosis with the external.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: devouring-type protagonist treats external world as fuel; all energy enters one person</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: grabbing resources and swallowing world are both the old road of &quot;possessing more = getting strong&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least does not &quot;devour&quot;; Ji Ning and Shi Hao both push predation to the extreme</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: under the devouring model Myriad Ranks are nourishment, not even fuel</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: swallowing the world is fundamentally opposed to an open cosmos</li></ul><p>Shi Hao and Ji Ning&#39;s predation comparison also has a time dimension: Shi Hao&#39;s devouring is irreversible; once swallowed it becomes part of his body; Ji Ning&#39;s plunder though zero-sum, at least resources still circulate in the external world. This means the Shi Hao model consumes the cosmos faster — every point stronger, the cosmos thinner. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s symbiotic model wants reversible, recyclable, sustainable, not eating the cosmos dry in one go.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ji Ning grabs resources, Shi Hao swallows the world — one grabs within stock, one even eats the cosmos itself. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer: getting strong need not presuppose possession; symbiosis also makes people strong. &quot;Taking the body as seed&quot; sounds domineering, but what is seeded inside one&#39;s own body is, after all, another&#39;s world.</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · Ji Ning vs. Shi Hao · predation comparison between Manghuang and Perfect World described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable; law self-consistency is backed by the law-first axiom, not drifting with narrative convenience.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./410_模块2-莽荒纪-纪宁vs叶凡-莽荒与遮天的孤道传承.html">Entry 410 · Ji Ning vs. Ye Fan</a> · <a href="./412_模块2-莽荒纪-纪宁vs唐三-莽荒与斗罗的穿越者对比.html">Entry 412 · Ji Ning vs. Tang San</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const c=t(s,[["render",a]]);export{m as __pageData,c as default};
